232	    // wizard, else the auto-derived `<username>.<base>`. Either way it lives under our
233	    // `*.<HOSTING_SUBDOMAIN_BASE>` wildcard, so it resolves + gets HTTPS automatically
234	    // (no A record for the customer to set). The chosen label is validated here and
235	    // de-duplicated by the SAME atomic UNIQUE(hostname) claim inside the charge tx —
